WEBVTT

02:19.600 --> 02:23.840
CLOVE BUD, CLOVE STEM
AGARWOOD, ASARUM FORBESII

02:25.160 --> 02:26.400
Miss, the scented sachets.

02:27.880 --> 02:31.040
Why do I feel Mei has changed
into another person?

02:31.920 --> 02:34.480
It must be because Mei
doesn't want to be recognized.

02:35.800 --> 02:37.680
Why haven't you changed
how you address her?

02:37.760 --> 02:39.600
She is now Miss Hua.

02:45.480 --> 02:47.680
The cheerful Miss Hua is very nice.

03:40.360 --> 03:41.520
Go away.

04:10.880 --> 04:14.560
YANLAI FRAGRANCE SHOP

04:22.480 --> 04:23.320
Mei.

04:24.760 --> 04:26.000
Miss Hua.

04:56.120 --> 04:58.720
As a Sun Kunlun with a flawed body,

04:58.800 --> 05:01.440
it's disrespectful to the deity.

05:01.520 --> 05:07.640
If he fails, the heavens will find
another divine messenger.

05:07.720 --> 05:08.560
Yes.

05:11.480 --> 05:12.840
Please spare my life, Your Majesty.

05:12.920 --> 05:14.320
Watch your master carefully.

05:14.400 --> 05:18.280
If he hurts himself
for the Great Yan woman again,

05:18.360 --> 05:19.880
I will skin you.

05:20.920 --> 05:21.840
Yes, Your Majesty.

05:28.360 --> 05:29.320
Your Highness,

05:30.800 --> 05:32.600
you must succeed this time.

05:34.680 --> 05:36.080
Qin.

05:43.080 --> 05:43.920
Your Majesty.

05:49.360 --> 05:51.800
What's the matter? Having a nightmare?

05:53.520 --> 05:54.520
No.

05:56.120 --> 05:57.760
I had a beautiful dream.

05:59.040 --> 06:01.080
In my dream, my brother came to Zhaojing

06:01.160 --> 06:03.120
and held the little prince,

06:03.200 --> 06:05.680
who bit him and left tooth marks
all over his face.

06:06.320 --> 06:08.360
The little prince seems
to love his uncle very much.

06:09.040 --> 06:11.960
He also likes his father very much.

06:12.560 --> 06:15.080
Each time Your Majesty
comes to Fanghua Palace,

06:15.160 --> 06:16.480
I can feel him moving.

06:17.960 --> 06:20.120
It's not even three months,
and he's already moving?

06:20.200 --> 06:23.680
Really. I can really feel him moving.

06:24.720 --> 06:25.600
Feel it yourself.

06:29.880 --> 06:31.080
He is moving.

06:34.480 --> 06:35.560
He is kicking me again.

06:37.520 --> 06:38.640
Don't be naughty.

06:39.240 --> 06:42.200
Alright, Your Majesty.
Don't be harsh towards him.

06:44.440 --> 06:45.800
Well,

06:45.880 --> 06:49.760
will he resemble me more or you more?

06:50.920 --> 06:53.160
You. It's better he does.

06:54.880 --> 06:55.840
No.

06:55.920 --> 06:58.000
I was very naughty when I was little.

06:58.080 --> 07:00.760
I upset my mother so much
that she couldn't eat.

07:00.840 --> 07:01.880
I don't want to be upset.

07:01.960 --> 07:03.880
He won't dare.

07:03.960 --> 07:06.280
With me here, he won't dare to upset you.

07:22.120 --> 07:23.480
What's wrong?

07:24.080 --> 07:25.200
Your Majesty,

07:28.080 --> 07:29.320
my belly hurts.

07:43.680 --> 07:46.040
Imperial physician!
Call the imperial physicians!

07:52.360 --> 07:54.480
FANGHUA PALACE

08:09.360 --> 08:11.600
Your Majesty.

08:12.560 --> 08:14.920
I'm afraid we can't keep the prince.

08:15.000 --> 08:15.920
How is Concubine Yan?

08:16.000 --> 08:17.680
I only care about Concubine Yan.

08:17.760 --> 08:21.080
Her Highness was injured before,

08:21.160 --> 08:22.920
making it difficult to conceive
and carry a child.

08:28.040 --> 08:29.280
Your Majesty.

08:29.880 --> 08:31.920
Your Majesty, I beg you, please wake up!

08:40.200 --> 08:43.520
Now, after the miscarriage
and postpartum hemorrhage,

08:44.520 --> 08:46.640
I am unable to stop the bleeding.

08:46.720 --> 08:50.160
Her Highness likely
has about two hours left.

08:51.360 --> 08:53.040
I am incompetent.

08:53.120 --> 08:55.160
Please pardon me, Your Majesty.

08:55.240 --> 08:57.480
Please pardon me, Your Majesty.

08:58.760 --> 09:01.000
- Your Majesty.
- Your Majesty.

09:17.400 --> 09:18.800
Your Majesty,

09:19.680 --> 09:20.920
you finally came.

09:23.640 --> 09:26.080
I feel like I'm fading.

09:29.200 --> 09:30.400
I don't allow you.

09:32.600 --> 09:34.000
Don't be afraid.

09:36.120 --> 09:38.400
I traded 20 years of my life

09:39.360 --> 09:41.200
with the deity,

09:43.040 --> 09:45.800
never expecting
it would be less than that.

09:47.280 --> 09:51.160
But the deity granted my request,
and I cannot go back on my word.

09:52.360 --> 09:54.040
Besides, I didn't lose out.

09:55.520 --> 09:57.040
By the gods above,

09:59.600 --> 10:01.480
I am the Emperor of Great Yan.

10:02.320 --> 10:03.880
I grant you 20 years of life

10:04.680 --> 10:06.520
in exchange for nullifying this contract.

10:12.640 --> 10:13.720
Your Majesty,

10:14.560 --> 10:16.720
don't irritate the deity.

10:16.800 --> 10:18.080
I'm not afraid.

10:21.280 --> 10:23.240
But I'm afraid.

10:24.760 --> 10:27.320
I fear that if we irritate the deity,

10:27.400 --> 10:30.400
I won't be able to see you
in my next life.

10:36.760 --> 10:38.400
It was my fault.

10:39.560 --> 10:41.160
I harmed you.

10:45.680 --> 10:48.160
I never regretted it.

10:50.520 --> 10:54.200
Meeting Your Majesty
has been my greatest joy.

10:57.360 --> 10:58.480
I just

11:00.400 --> 11:01.880
can't bear to part with you.

11:06.520 --> 11:08.720
I can't bear to part with my brother

11:10.040 --> 11:12.800
or our little prince.

11:15.600 --> 11:19.320
I don't want to be a peace-making marriage
princess in my next life.

11:23.560 --> 11:24.400
Okay.

11:25.680 --> 11:26.920
In the next life,

11:28.520 --> 11:29.960
I'll meet you in Xiyan.

11:31.240 --> 11:35.760
You just be my Zigu. Alright?

11:41.840 --> 11:44.200
It's very difficult to get

11:45.240 --> 11:47.400
Princess Zigu's jade ring.

11:47.480 --> 11:48.640
I will try hard.

11:49.600 --> 11:50.680
I can get it.

11:55.560 --> 11:56.680
I believe in you.

12:11.600 --> 12:12.960
Look.

12:16.880 --> 12:19.040
The Yisang flower is blooming.

12:40.560 --> 12:41.640
Zigu.

12:42.440 --> 12:43.680
Zigu.

12:45.800 --> 12:47.640
Zigu.

12:56.320 --> 12:57.360
Zigu.

13:22.720 --> 13:26.360
Your Majesty, you've gone a full day
and night without rest.

13:26.440 --> 13:28.440
You must take care of your health.

13:33.800 --> 13:35.080
- Wang Bao.
- Yes.

13:35.920 --> 13:39.200
Handle Concubine Yan's
funeral arrangements in secret.

13:40.480 --> 13:44.520
Also, arrange for Chagu, her maid,

13:45.320 --> 13:46.520
to secretly meet Prince Jing

13:47.600 --> 13:50.320
- in Qingzhou immediately.
- Yes.

14:04.880 --> 14:06.000
Zigu,

14:07.720 --> 14:09.160
it is unfair to you.

14:12.000 --> 14:14.240
The situation in Xiyan is unstable.

14:16.160 --> 14:19.000
I fear the pro-war faction may seize
this chance to stir up trouble.

14:21.120 --> 14:22.720
Your funeral arrangements

14:23.920 --> 14:25.600
must be kept secret.

14:26.200 --> 14:28.240
I will notify your brother in secret.

14:30.880 --> 14:33.000
Once he stabilizes the situation in Xiyan,

14:35.520 --> 14:36.680
I will give you

14:38.760 --> 14:41.280
a full Noble Consort's state funeral.

14:46.360 --> 14:47.200
YANLAI FRAGRANCE SHOP

14:47.280 --> 14:48.760
- Let's take a look.
- Take care.

14:48.840 --> 14:49.880
Let's take a look.

14:51.200 --> 14:53.000
Thank you for visiting.

14:53.080 --> 14:54.560
We will deliver the goods shortly.

14:54.640 --> 14:57.960
I've long heard you are very skilled.
If it's good, I'll come again.

14:58.040 --> 14:58.880
- Come and take a look.
- Farewell.

14:58.960 --> 15:00.840
New trinkets.

15:00.920 --> 15:02.280
Miss, take a look.

15:03.640 --> 15:05.400
- Your Excellency.
- They are selling well today.

15:06.200 --> 15:07.240
The matter has been taken care of.

15:07.840 --> 15:08.680
Thank you.

15:09.600 --> 15:10.440
You are welcome, Your Excellency.

15:11.320 --> 15:12.160
Madam.

15:12.240 --> 15:14.280
YIXIANG BLACKSMITH

15:14.360 --> 15:16.240
How can I accept your gold?

15:16.320 --> 15:19.480
Without Your Excellency, Changle House
wouldn't be what it is today.

15:19.560 --> 15:23.160
Booking the scented sachets for a month
is not a big deal for Changle House.

15:23.240 --> 15:27.920
It's a private matter,
so I can't let you pay for it.

15:29.960 --> 15:31.440
Madam, take it.

15:32.440 --> 15:34.160
Thank you, Your Excellency.

15:41.800 --> 15:43.680
You have very good taste.

15:43.760 --> 15:46.520
Miss Hua, the new girl
in Yanlai Fragrance Shop, is very skilled.

15:46.600 --> 15:48.400
Please keep it a secret.

15:48.480 --> 15:51.880
Don't let Miss Hua know
His Excellency ordered them.

15:53.640 --> 15:55.040
Understood.

15:55.120 --> 15:57.080
Rest assured, Your Excellency.
I understand.

15:57.160 --> 15:59.520
This month's revenue doubled.

15:59.600 --> 16:04.560
The Lone Butterfly's Dance style
that Miss Hua created sells out every day.

16:04.640 --> 16:06.800
The manager of Changle House

16:06.880 --> 16:08.120
just ordered scented sachets
enough for a month.

16:09.160 --> 16:10.720
Miss Hua is clever and skilled.

16:10.800 --> 16:13.440
Back then, her embroidery
was the best among us.

16:14.680 --> 16:16.920
With guidance, I can certainly excel
in embroidery.

16:17.640 --> 16:19.840
- The fragrances here are good.
- Really?

16:19.920 --> 16:20.760
Let's go take a look.

16:20.840 --> 16:22.320
YANLAI FRAGRANCE SHOP

16:22.400 --> 16:23.560
Pick this one.

16:25.040 --> 16:27.040
This one. And try this one.

16:27.120 --> 16:28.240
This one is also pretty.

16:28.320 --> 16:29.160
This is not bad.

16:29.240 --> 16:30.360
I like this one.

16:44.640 --> 16:47.200
Miss Hua, formerly Mei Lin,

16:47.280 --> 16:49.560
has shed her identity
as the Princess Heir.

16:54.000 --> 16:55.480
I entrusted her to the wrong person.

16:58.080 --> 16:59.280
If she weren't so smart,

17:00.040 --> 17:01.600
she would be trapped

17:01.680 --> 17:03.720
in the palace of Xiyan
for the rest of her life.

17:10.839 --> 17:14.520
SILK SHOP

17:22.119 --> 17:23.480
Take a look.

17:23.560 --> 17:25.359
Freshly spun thread.

17:25.440 --> 17:27.200
Candied haws.

17:27.280 --> 17:28.920
All the new colors.

17:31.320 --> 17:34.320
SPRING FLOWER CAKE SHOP

17:35.760 --> 17:37.800
The cake shop opens in a few days.

17:37.880 --> 17:39.800
Isn't it too early for the sign?

17:41.040 --> 17:42.040
Since the border trade began,

17:42.120 --> 17:44.560
people have been coming
to Qingzhou for business.

17:44.640 --> 17:46.520
Many cake shops have opened already.

17:46.600 --> 17:49.120
We need to put up our shop sign early

17:49.200 --> 17:52.840
to attract customers
and boost our business operations.

17:57.600 --> 17:59.920
Hang it there. That is better.

18:02.920 --> 18:04.560
Once the Crown Prince
faces his punishment,

18:04.640 --> 18:07.800
I will help you open
a Spring Flower Cake Shop.

18:07.880 --> 18:09.160
It's a deal.

18:14.040 --> 18:16.880
Another wish of yours has been fulfilled.

18:17.600 --> 18:20.120
Miss Hua, Yi, I bought firecrackers

18:20.200 --> 18:21.680
to celebrate Miss Hua
becoming a shopkeeper.

18:22.280 --> 18:24.080
- Come on.
- Thank you, Wei.

18:47.520 --> 18:50.000
SPRING FLOWER CAKE SHOP

18:53.760 --> 18:55.120
Are you okay, Miss Hua?

18:59.320 --> 19:00.720
- Mei…
- Qingyan.

19:05.560 --> 19:09.440
Your Excellency, she is a new worker
in Yanlai Fragrance Shop, Miss Hua.

19:09.520 --> 19:10.560
Your Excellency,

19:10.640 --> 19:13.680
she looks like Mei Lin, right?
I feel the same.

19:13.760 --> 19:15.160
She is a widow who escaped from Mozhou.

19:16.080 --> 19:17.280
Her husband died a long time ago.

19:17.920 --> 19:19.120
She is mute.

19:27.360 --> 19:28.840
The situation was urgent.

19:28.920 --> 19:31.840
Please pardon me if I've offended you.

19:48.560 --> 19:51.040
Stop talking nonsense.
I'll tell the shopkeeper.

19:51.120 --> 19:53.440
- I didn't.
- Don't deny it.

20:01.760 --> 20:02.680
Here it is.

20:03.960 --> 20:04.800
Everything is here.

20:13.280 --> 20:17.320
You promised not to tell him,
but you hinted at it.

20:17.400 --> 20:19.840
I should've kept you locked
in the spice house.

20:19.920 --> 20:22.400
The governor is very kind.

20:22.480 --> 20:23.320
Wei.

20:24.760 --> 20:25.960
Thank you.

20:26.640 --> 20:28.480
We shouldn't hide it from him.

20:28.560 --> 20:31.160
He was protecting Miss Hua.

20:31.920 --> 20:33.160
What's good about him?

20:34.440 --> 20:35.760
Mei doesn't need him.

20:36.760 --> 20:38.720
He was pretending to care.

20:38.800 --> 20:42.040
When Miss Mei was in a coma,
the governor was heartbroken.

20:42.120 --> 20:44.280
Well, we all saw it.

20:44.360 --> 20:46.360
It wasn't fake.

21:00.080 --> 21:01.120
Indeed.

21:01.760 --> 21:06.600
He refused to believe you were dead
and never left your side.

21:06.680 --> 21:10.800
If he knew you were alive,
how could he ignore you?

21:12.000 --> 21:14.880
Didn't he recognize you?

21:17.160 --> 21:18.440
He did.

21:19.560 --> 21:23.280
But he also knows
I don't want to be the old Mei Lin,

21:23.360 --> 21:25.000
and he respected that.

21:26.880 --> 21:29.600
Mei, don't let him fool you again.

21:31.200 --> 21:32.120
Don't worry.

21:33.040 --> 21:34.600
It's better this way.

21:34.680 --> 21:36.760
We don't have to hide anything anymore.

21:37.960 --> 21:40.000
Can you and the governor
go back to how things were?

21:46.240 --> 21:49.120
I just want to live as Miss Hua now.

21:54.160 --> 21:56.040
To him, Miss Hua is just

21:57.000 --> 21:58.920
a stranger he's met once.

22:04.040 --> 22:06.840
Right. Let's stop talking about him.

22:07.440 --> 22:09.920
Big Guy, didn't you bring Red Fruit Wine

22:10.000 --> 22:11.640
to celebrate the cake shop opening?

22:12.280 --> 22:13.960
Yes. I'll get it.

22:15.520 --> 22:18.040
Let's eat and celebrate.

22:18.120 --> 22:19.600
I couldn't find Red Fruits,

22:19.680 --> 22:22.880
so I used local gooseberries

22:22.960 --> 22:24.360
to brew it.

22:24.440 --> 22:25.600
It's the same.

22:26.240 --> 22:28.200
- Let me pour the drinks.
- Okay.

22:28.280 --> 22:29.640
Okay.

22:29.720 --> 22:30.800
Come on.

22:34.120 --> 22:37.160
To Miss Hua for letting go of the past

22:37.240 --> 22:38.480
and starting a new life!

22:38.560 --> 22:40.680
Cheers to a prosperous
Spring Flower Cake Shop!

22:40.760 --> 22:42.040
Prosperous business.

22:42.120 --> 22:43.080
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

22:43.160 --> 22:44.400
- Cheers.
- Cheers.

22:49.160 --> 22:50.680
Let me fill your cups.

22:50.760 --> 22:53.360
Come on. Let me toast to you all.

22:54.040 --> 22:56.840
I'm happy to have met you all.

22:56.920 --> 23:00.240
I hope we'll stay together for life.

23:00.320 --> 23:02.600
Mei, we will, for sure.

23:03.360 --> 23:04.800
- For a lifetime.
- For a lifetime.

23:04.880 --> 23:05.960
- Cheers.
- Cheers!

23:08.960 --> 23:12.680
I'll always be with Mei,
but someone else might not.

23:12.760 --> 23:14.720
She may get married someday.

23:16.400 --> 23:18.120
Who's getting married?

23:18.200 --> 23:19.400
You won't marry?

23:19.480 --> 23:20.760
Didn't you say you'd marry

23:20.840 --> 23:22.280
when the spice house
made 10,000 taels of gold?

23:22.880 --> 23:24.200
I won't marry.

23:24.280 --> 23:26.240
Men are blind and blockheaded.

23:26.840 --> 23:28.200
I can live well on my own.

23:28.280 --> 23:33.480
But you clearly said you would marry.

23:34.920 --> 23:38.120
Big Guy, listen,
you promised to listen to me.

23:38.200 --> 23:40.960
So, stop talking or talking back.

23:41.720 --> 23:43.040
Don't get close to that guy.

23:50.600 --> 23:52.320
YANLAI FRAGRANCE SHOP

23:59.000 --> 24:01.000
Miss, let me send…

24:06.320 --> 24:07.600
Big Guy,

24:08.520 --> 24:09.400
why are you

24:10.800 --> 24:12.040
so obedient to me?

24:17.160 --> 24:18.320
You can speak now.

24:18.400 --> 24:19.920
Tell me.

24:20.000 --> 24:21.960
Why are you so obedient to me?

24:27.800 --> 24:31.360
B-b-because you are the shopkeeper.

24:32.440 --> 24:34.080
From now on,

24:34.680 --> 24:36.720
don't treat me like the shopkeeper.

24:39.720 --> 24:41.880
You… Are you driving me away?

24:43.440 --> 24:44.640
You are really a blockhead.

24:45.440 --> 24:50.160
You should stay in the spice house,
by my side, and not go anywhere.

24:56.680 --> 25:00.280
- Well? You're unwilling?
- I'm willing.

25:01.680 --> 25:02.640
I…

25:03.840 --> 25:06.480
Jia, I'm willing.

25:08.600 --> 25:10.240
Now…

25:12.880 --> 25:14.600
Send me back to my room.

25:15.520 --> 25:16.600
Okay.

25:18.640 --> 25:19.480
Slowly.

25:22.040 --> 25:23.720
GOVERNOR'S MANSION

25:29.240 --> 25:30.920
It's good enough

25:32.560 --> 25:33.800
to be around you like this.

25:36.760 --> 25:39.920
FENGCAO PAVILION

25:41.640 --> 25:43.680
My lord, how is your injury?

25:45.320 --> 25:47.720
I'm fine. What did you find?

25:48.680 --> 25:49.960
I brought back some scraps.

25:50.760 --> 25:53.880
I found it strange.
The firecrackers weren't normal.

26:03.120 --> 26:04.280
Tung oil.

26:05.040 --> 26:07.320
Tung oil is used
in military fire oil bombs.

26:11.920 --> 26:14.160
Investigate all fireworks shops
in the city tomorrow,

26:14.240 --> 26:15.840
but do it secretly.

26:16.520 --> 26:17.600
Yes.

26:17.680 --> 26:21.080
SPRING FLOWER CAKE SHOP

26:27.080 --> 26:28.200
It smells great.

26:28.280 --> 26:30.800
It takes an hour to steam them.

26:30.880 --> 26:32.840
When the market gets busy,

26:32.920 --> 26:34.400
we might not keep up with demand.

26:35.200 --> 26:36.520
It's okay. Let's make more.

26:40.120 --> 26:43.240
- Miss, I want two Dengguo Cakes.
- Okay.

26:43.320 --> 26:46.080
- Yi, give him three.
- Okay.

26:46.160 --> 26:47.280
Thank you, Miss.

26:53.920 --> 26:56.600
Mister, I've bought the cakes you ordered.

27:34.040 --> 27:35.120
Miss Hua,

27:36.840 --> 27:40.040
this flour should last
your shop several days.

27:40.840 --> 27:41.880
Thank you, Wei.

27:41.960 --> 27:44.720
Oh, right, I passed the patrol camp
on my way back.

27:44.800 --> 27:46.920
They want to order ten trays…

27:48.080 --> 27:49.120
Five, six.

27:49.200 --> 27:50.520
Six trays of Dengguo Cake.

27:51.760 --> 27:52.800
Here.

27:53.520 --> 27:54.640
The patrol camp ordered them?

27:55.240 --> 27:56.080
Yes.

27:57.040 --> 27:58.920
I need to go back to help Jia.

27:59.000 --> 28:00.480
I can't help you deliver them.

28:00.560 --> 28:03.160
- Don't forget.
- Okay.

28:11.680 --> 28:12.760
I'll check how many we need.

28:14.120 --> 28:14.960
Gods bless them.

28:15.560 --> 28:17.040
I've spent all my savings.

28:17.120 --> 28:20.560
May the governor and Mei Lin reunite.

28:32.240 --> 28:34.800
Sir, it's past the hour of Si,
and no one has picked up the goods.

28:37.720 --> 28:40.040
- Something is off. Retreat.
- Yes.

28:45.400 --> 28:47.920
Arrest them all for questioning.

28:49.520 --> 28:51.360
It's a misunderstanding.

28:51.440 --> 28:54.760
Your Excellency,
I'm a legitimate fireworks merchant.

28:54.840 --> 28:57.000
Why do you need to inspect my goods?

28:57.080 --> 28:59.760
We'll confirm that after inspection.

29:00.920 --> 29:02.160
Well…

29:09.120 --> 29:10.120
Hurry, go!

29:10.760 --> 29:11.600
Hurry!

29:12.360 --> 29:13.680
Go!

29:17.400 --> 29:18.280
Go this way.

29:22.960 --> 29:24.080
Hurry!

29:59.600 --> 30:01.600
While recruiting in southern Mozhou,

30:01.680 --> 30:04.280
I uncovered Xiyan spies
hidden within a merchant caravan,

30:04.880 --> 30:08.240
smuggling fire oil bombs
disguised as fireworks to Qingzhou.

30:09.240 --> 30:13.080
I suspected something
and followed them with Jiangtu.

30:13.760 --> 30:14.920
I didn't expect to run into you.

30:15.520 --> 30:18.160
I found tung oil in the firecrackers here,

30:18.240 --> 30:22.960
likely from the same Xiyan spies
as those in Mozhou.

30:24.120 --> 30:27.160
My lord, they confessed.

30:27.240 --> 30:28.880
The fireworks were headed
for the patrol camp.

30:30.000 --> 30:31.120
The patrol camp.

30:31.200 --> 30:35.560
The patrol camp recently began
recruiting locals from Qingzhou,

30:36.440 --> 30:37.360
and training has started today.

30:37.440 --> 30:41.040
However, there are Xiyan spies
among the recruits,

30:41.120 --> 30:43.040
aiming to sabotage from within.

30:45.480 --> 30:48.080
The pro-war faction of Xiyan,
led by Mingju, still covets Qingzhou.

30:48.160 --> 30:49.240
If conflict erupts,

30:49.320 --> 30:52.120
Qingzhou's insufficient defenses
could fall easily.

30:53.800 --> 30:56.200
Luckily, we intercepted
their weapons shipment.

30:56.280 --> 30:58.840
Find the Xiyan spies
in the patrol camp quickly

30:58.920 --> 31:00.560
to prevent further action by Mingju.

31:00.640 --> 31:01.520
Okay.

31:24.160 --> 31:25.400
General,

31:28.160 --> 31:29.960
do you know who ordered the cakes?

31:39.520 --> 31:41.600
There is a spy! ̀Here!

31:59.360 --> 32:01.240
- You…
- Your Excellency.

32:02.880 --> 32:05.280
Miss Hua, leave His Excellency to me.

32:05.360 --> 32:07.400
- Help His Excellency return.
- Okay.

32:29.520 --> 32:32.160
Miss, you're injured.

32:36.200 --> 32:37.600
Miss.

32:40.520 --> 32:43.160
- Escort her to treat the wound.
- Please, Miss.

32:49.080 --> 32:51.600
General, that pile of grass is suspicious.

32:54.720 --> 32:55.800
Thank you.

33:09.160 --> 33:10.360
Why hasn't Prince Jing awoken?

33:10.440 --> 33:12.840
Though medicine was applied,
the bleeding persists.

33:12.920 --> 33:14.680
We must stop it immediately.

33:16.480 --> 33:18.040
- What's wrong with Prince Jing?
- You've finally come.

33:18.120 --> 33:20.560
- Hurry. You all go out.
- Yes.

33:52.320 --> 33:53.160
How is he?

33:55.320 --> 33:59.480
Prince Jing was weakened by testing
the Momai antidote,

34:00.040 --> 34:02.080
harming both Qi and blood.

34:02.160 --> 34:04.040
Coupled with this wound,

34:04.720 --> 34:07.160
the bleeding won't cease.

34:07.720 --> 34:10.400
A special hemostatic was used.

34:10.480 --> 34:13.600
With rest, recovery is expected.

34:16.920 --> 34:17.880
My lord.

34:20.560 --> 34:22.320
My lord, you are awake.

34:24.800 --> 34:26.120
Mei Lin.

34:27.040 --> 34:28.520
How is Mei Lin?

34:29.520 --> 34:32.040
Don't worry, my lord.
Miss Mei Lin's injury is minor.

34:32.120 --> 34:33.600
Her wound is dressed.

34:36.080 --> 34:37.080
Qingyan,

34:38.760 --> 34:40.639
her martial arts have been lost.

34:43.040 --> 34:46.159
But… Yi said Mei Lin fled to her death

34:46.679 --> 34:49.719
because she was imprisoned
by the Prince Heir.

34:49.800 --> 34:53.280
Could the Prince Heir have sealed them
to keep her captive?

34:53.360 --> 34:54.760
Investigate

34:55.840 --> 34:57.920
all she endured

34:58.960 --> 35:00.760
in the palace of Xiyan.

35:02.400 --> 35:04.280
I want to know everything.

35:05.000 --> 35:05.840
Yes.

35:06.400 --> 35:08.160
Her suffering

35:09.160 --> 35:10.760
is due to me.

35:14.080 --> 35:15.960
You are already trying to make amends.

35:16.560 --> 35:19.200
You risked your life to get the Snow
Dragon Whisker from the Crown Prince.

35:19.280 --> 35:20.720
The poison in her is purged.

35:21.480 --> 35:23.000
Don't blame yourself too much.

35:25.040 --> 35:27.000
This is what I owe her.

35:30.400 --> 35:31.760
From now on,

35:33.280 --> 35:35.800
protect her in secret.

35:37.800 --> 35:39.920
I want her safe

35:41.200 --> 35:42.480
for the rest of her life.

36:33.560 --> 36:36.440
Keep moving forward,
and you will find a way to survive.

36:43.240 --> 36:46.200
- Mei Lin.
- The road will be brighter as you go.

36:50.480 --> 36:51.560
Your Highness,

36:53.080 --> 36:54.040
I'm back.

36:54.800 --> 36:55.640
Mei Lin.

36:58.920 --> 37:00.520
Gods bless you. Your Highness.

37:01.280 --> 37:03.040
Your Highness, you are finally awake.

37:04.200 --> 37:05.040
Your Highness.

37:09.680 --> 37:10.520
Your Highness.

37:11.520 --> 37:12.360
Your Highness.

37:12.440 --> 37:14.280
You must rest more, Your Highness.

37:20.000 --> 37:22.720
- Step aside!
- Your Highness. Your Highness.

37:24.240 --> 37:25.080
Your Highness.

37:26.600 --> 37:29.560
Your Highness,
the Princess Heir has passed,

37:30.160 --> 37:32.400
but you still have the princess.
Please think of the princess.

37:34.040 --> 37:38.440
If something happens to you,
what will she do in Great Yan?

37:41.440 --> 37:43.040
I beg you, Your Highness.

37:44.960 --> 37:47.440
Oh, right. Right.
The princess has sent you a letter.

37:47.520 --> 37:49.880
It's a secret letter from Great Yan.
Here, Your Highness.

37:54.440 --> 37:55.680
Your Highness.

38:09.120 --> 38:10.680
Concubine Yan has passed,

38:11.320 --> 38:15.480
and I share your sorrow.

38:16.360 --> 38:18.760
For the sake of peace
between our countries,

38:19.640 --> 38:23.000
please suppress your grief
and seek a resolution to the conflict.

39:12.600 --> 39:13.680
Will we…?

39:14.840 --> 39:16.920
Will we meet again in this lifetime?

39:49.480 --> 39:53.120
Qin, congratulations.
You'll soon be an uncle.

39:55.600 --> 39:58.640
The little prince wants a wooden horse,

39:58.720 --> 40:01.440
larger than the one you gave me
when we were young.

40:03.720 --> 40:06.680
It's not me. The little prince asks this.

40:07.760 --> 40:08.680
He is here.

40:22.920 --> 40:27.680
Your Highness, the princess urged you
to make the wooden horse again?
